      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَرَّادٌ</span></b>  <i>A strangler</i> or <i>one who throttles,</i> or
<i>squeezes the throat;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَنَّاقٌ</span>. (A, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
And <i>A fabricator of coats of mail;</i> (S, A, K;)
as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَرَّادٌ</span>. (TA.)

